      "content": "thanks for these. they're a good foundation but honestly they're a bit too \"safe\" for a high-stakes debate. my student is going to get absolutely crushed if they just use these \"critics argue\" style points. \n\nin a real competitive round, we need to move past these polite academic objections and really expose the argument for what it is. can you rewrite these to be way more aggressive and hard-hitting? I want them to sound like they're exposing the UBI position as a fundamental economic absurdity rather than just a different policy view. give me some punchy, devastating rebuttals that they can use to shut down the other side's claims entirely.",
